  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Flood Forecasting and Warning System in Licungo River Basin, Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distribution of flood information in short time and mitigate the damage for human life and properties through the proper operation of the flood forecasting and warning system in Licungo river basin; Collection of rapid and accurate water resources information and processing through advanced hydrology measurement technique; Accumulation of accurate information and statistics for reasonable water resources management such as flood damage mitigation; Cost and budget reduction in national and regional water resources management through efficient water resources task implementation; Safe living for everyone: flood management through accurate and rapid flood information; Achieve SDGs goals: SDG 2, SDG 11, SDG 13&#x25a3; Licungo&#xac15; &#xc720;&#xc5ed;&#xc758; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0; &#xc815;&#xbcf4; &#xbc0f; &#xd64d;&#xc218;&#xc758; &#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; Licungo&#xac15; &#xc720;&#xc5ed;&#xc758; &#xd64d;&#xc218; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xbc0f; &#xbb3c; &#xc7ac;&#xd574; &#xb300;&#xc751;&#xb2a5;&#xb825; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
